{"id": "15-885-2-3", "zh": "也就是：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-885-4-153", "zh": "bhūto、parābhūto、sambhūto、vibhūto、pātubhūto、āvibhūto、tirobhūto、vinābhūto、bhabbo、paribhūto、abhibhūto、adhibhūto、addhabhūto、anubhūto、samanubhūto、paccanubhūto、bhāvito、sambhāvito、vibhāvito、paribhāvito、anuparibhūto、paribhavitabbo、paribhotabbo、paribhavanīyo、abhibhavitabbo、abhibhotabbo、abhibhavanīyo、adhibhavitabbo、adhibhotabbo、adhibhavanīyo、anubhavitabbo、anubhotabbo、anubhavanīyo、samanubhavitabbo、samanubhotabbo、samanubhavanīyo、paccanubhavitabbo、paccanubhotabbo、paccanubhavanīyo、bhāvetabbo、bhāvanīyo、sambhāvetabbo、sambhāvanīyo、vibhāvetabbo、vibhāvanīyo、paribhāvetabbo、paribhāvanīyo、bhavamāno、vibhavamāno、paribhavamāno、abhibhavamāno、anubhavamāno、samanubhavamāno、paccanubhavamāno、anubhonto、samanubhonto、paccanubhonto、sambhonto、abhisambhonto、bhāvento、sambhāvento、vibhāvento、paribhāvento、paribhaviyamāno、paribhuyyamāno、abhibhaviyamāno、abhibhūyamāno、anubhaviyamāno、anubhuyyamāno、samanubhaviyamāno、samanubhuyyamāno、paccanubhaviyamāno、paccanubhuyyamāno——这些是列入定性阳性词中的词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-885-154-162", "zh": "就这样，按以 o 结尾等方式，阐明了由 bhū 词根构成的六类阳性词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-885-163-167", "zh": "以上先是按阳性列举的例词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-886-2-13", "zh": "bhāvikā、bhāvanā、vibhāvanā、sambhāvanā、paribhāvanā——这是以 ā 结尾的阴性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-887-2-7", "zh": "bhūmi、bhūti、vibhūti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-887-8-10", "zh": "这是以 i 结尾的阴性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-888-2-47", "zh": "bhūrī、bhūtī、bhotī、vibhāvinī、parivibhāvinī、sambhāvinī、pātubhavantī、pātubhontī、paribhavantī、paribhontī、abhibhavantī、abhibhontī、adhibhavantī、adhibhontī、anubhavantī、anubhontī、samanubhavantī、samanubhontī、paccanubhavantī、paccanubhontī、abhisambhavantī、abhisambhontī——这是以 ī 结尾的阴性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-889-2-5", "zh": "bhū、abhū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-889-6-8", "zh": "这是以 ū 结尾的阴性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-890-2-8", "zh": "这里列举了由 bhū 词根构成的这四类阴性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-891-2-20", "zh": "由 bhū 词根构成、以 u 结尾的阴性词并不常见，但由其他词根构成、以 u 结尾的阴性词却很常见，例如“dhātu、dhenu”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-891-21-40", "zh": "连同这类在内，阴性词就有五类；或者，如果把以 o 结尾的 go 一词算作阴性，连同它也可以有六类。应当知道，这些全都是本来就是阴性的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-891-41-47", "zh": "在这里，不定性的 bhūta、parābhūta、sambhūta 等词，也可以按阴性来使用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-892-2-3", "zh": "怎样呢？", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-892-4-23", "zh": "bhūtā、parābhūtā、sambhūtā——全部都应当照样详细列出，但要除去“anubhonto、samanubhonto”等九个词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-892-24-29", "zh": "因为这些已经按以 ī 结尾的形式组配过了。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-892-30-33", "zh": "这些是列入定性词中的词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-892-34-42", "zh": "就这样，按以 ā 结尾等方式，阐明了由 bhū 词根构成的四类阴性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-892-43-46", "zh": "以上是按阴性列举的例词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-893-2-40", "zh": "bhūtaṃ、mahābhūtaṃ、bhavittaṃ、bhūnaṃ、bhavanaṃ、parābhavanaṃ、sambhavanaṃ、vibhavanaṃ、pātubhavanaṃ、āvibhavanaṃ、tirobhavanaṃ、vinābhavanaṃ、sotthibhavanaṃ、paribhavanaṃ、abhibhavanaṃ、adhibhavanaṃ、anubhavanaṃ、samanubhavanaṃ、paccanubhavanaṃ——这是以鼻音（niggahīta）结尾的中性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-894-2-5", "zh": "atthavibhāvi、dhammavibhāvi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-894-6-8", "zh": "这是以 i 结尾的中性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-895-2-7", "zh": "gotrabhu、cittasahabhu、nacittasahabhu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-895-8-10", "zh": "这是以 u 结尾的中性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-896-2-6", "zh": "应当知道，这些全都是本来就是中性的词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-896-7-14", "zh": "这里还应当知道：表示有情、大种与色的 bhūta 一词，必定是中性词。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "15-896-15-23", "zh": "在这里，不定性的 bhūta、parābhūta、sambhūta 等词，也可以按中性来使用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-897-2-3", "zh": "怎样呢？", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-897-4-11", "zh": "bhūtaṃ、parābhūtaṃ、sambhūtaṃ、vibhūtaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-897-12-13", "zh": "……（中略）……", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-897-14-67", "zh": "samanubhavamānaṃ、paccanubhavamānaṃ、anubhontaṃ、anubhavantaṃ、samanubhontaṃ、samanubhavantaṃ、paccanubhontaṃ、paccanubhavantaṃ、sambhontaṃ、sambhavantaṃ、abhisambhontaṃ、abhisambhavantaṃ、pātubhontaṃ、pātubhavantaṃ、paribhontaṃ、paribhavantaṃ、abhibhontaṃ、abhibhavantaṃ、adhibhontaṃ、adhibhavantaṃ、bhāventaṃ、sambhāventaṃ、vibhāventaṃ、paribhāventaṃ、paribhāviyamānaṃ、paribhuyyamānaṃ……（中略）……", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-897-68-74", "zh": "paccanubhaviyamānaṃ、paccanubhuyyamānaṃ——这些是列入定性中性词中的词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-897-75-83", "zh": "就这样，按以鼻音结尾等方式，阐明了由 bhū 词根构成的三类中性词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-897-84-93", "zh": "以上是按中性列举的例词。这样，就按阳性等方式，列举了由 bhū 词根构成的三种性。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-898-2-10", "zh": "这里我所阐明的那些不常见的词，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-899-2-8", "zh": "有智慧的人应当到圣典各处去寻找。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-900-2-17", "zh": "以 o、ā、鼻音、i、ī、u、ū 结尾，共有七种，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-901-2-8", "zh": "应当知道是阳性的类别——这是精通语法的人所说的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-902-2-12", "zh": "ā，以及 i 类音和 u 类音，按本形共有五种词尾，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-903-2-9", "zh": "应当知道是阴性的类别；或者连同以 o 结尾的，也可以是六种。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-904-2-12", "zh": "鼻音、i、u 这三种词尾，有智慧的人应当知道，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-905-2-6", "zh": "是中性的类别——这是精通语法的人所说的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-906-2-11", "zh": "阳性的词尾正好七种，阴性的是五种或六种；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-907-2-9", "zh": "中性的是三种。这样合起来，是十五种或十六种。", "confidence": 60}
